{"shortDescription":"RNS Number : 5165V  Kelso Group Holdings PLC  21 September 2026   \t\t\t\t\t21 September 2026Kelso Group Holdings Plc(\"Kelso\" or the “Company”)Result of Retail Offerand TVRKelso, the main market listed acquisition vehicle, is pleased to announce that the Retail Offer, as announced at 7:01am on 10 Septem…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":["RNS Number : 5165V  Kelso Group Holdings PLC  21 September 2026   \t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["21 September 2026"]},{"type":"p","children":["Kelso Group Holdings Plc"]},{"type":"p","children":["(\"Kelso\" or the “Company”)"]},{"type":"p","children":["Result of Retail Offer"]},{"type":"p","children":["and TVR"]},{"type":"p","children":["Kelso, the main market listed acquisition vehicle, is pleased to announce that the Retail Offer, as announced at 7:01am on 10 September 2026 (the \"Retail Launch Announcement\"), has now closed. The Retail Offer raised in aggregate £188,619 through the issuance of 5,715,712 new Ordinary Shares (the “Retail Offer Shares”) at a price of 3.3 pence per Retail Offer Share (the \"Issue Price\")."]},{"type":"p","children":["Further to the announcement on 17 September 2026, the Company has raised total gross proceeds pursuant to the Placing, Subscription and Retail Offer, of £3,188,619  through the issue of 96,624,802 new Ordinary Shares (the “Fundraising Shares”)."]},{"type":"p","children":["Director Participation"]},{"type":"p","children":["Certain Directors, being Sir Nigel Knowles and Jamie Brooke, have subscribed for 3,787,878 new Ordinary Shares pursuant to the Fundraise at the Issue Price, representing an aggregate investment of approximately £125,000. In addition, Ian Selby, applied for 303,030 new Ordinary Shares through the Retail Offer at the Issue Price, representing an investment of approximately £10,000."]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"