er cent of Kelso and between them have more than 150 years of experience in UK listed companies, across fund management, private equity, corporate finance, law and M\u0026A advisory. Kelso's strategy is to hold a concentrated portfolio of around ten UK companies, each of which it considers to be among the most attractive opportunities in the UK small and mid-cap market. Kelso invests only in established, profitable businesses, predominantly market leaders with strong balance sheets. Kelso does not invest in early stage, speculative or highly cyclical businesses and does not seek resources sector exposure."]},{"type":"p","children":["Kelso's aim is to generate market leading compounded annual returns for shareholders. The Board is closely aligned with shareholders through its substantial equity ownership."]},{"type":"p","children":["The information below is set out in accordance with the requirements of the Market Abuse Regulation:"]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["1."]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":2},"children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["Details of the person discharging managerial responsibilities / person closely associated"]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["a."]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["Name"]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["Sir Nigel Knowles"]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["2."]},"\t\t\t\t\t"]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":2},"children":["\t\t\t\t\t\t",{"type":"p","children":["Reason for the no